# Walkthrough - Global Filter Scrollability & Consistency (Phase 2)

This phase completes the refactoring of all filter dropdowns to a consistent, scrollable, and premium custom dropdown component.

## Changes Made

### Manage Data Refinement
- Converted residual native `<select>` elements for oil and gas unit conversion to custom dropdowns.
- Updated the initialization logic to ensure all custom dropdowns on the "Manage Data" page function correctly.

### Dashboard & Carbon Intensity Standardization
- Migrated manual dropdown toggle and selection logic in [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js) and [carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js) to use the shared [setupCustomDropdownHelper](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/reports-logic.js#765-801) function.
- This ensures that all dropdowns behave identically, including "click outside to close" and visual transitions.
- Improved the state management for dynamic filters (Activity, Division, Region) to be more robust.

## Components Refactored

| Page | Refactored Element(s) |
| :--- | :--- |
| [manage-data.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/manage-data.html) | Oil Unit, Gas Unit (Conversion Tools) |
| [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js) | Activity Filter, Division Filter, Region Filter |
| [carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js) | Year Filter, Activity Filter, Division Filter, Region Filter |

## Verification Results

### Visual Consistency
- All dropdowns now share the same premium look: blurred backgrounds, subtle borders, and smooth hover effects.
- Dynamic dropdowns (like Facilities/Regions) correctly update their lists based on parent selections.

### Functionality
- **Selection**: Selecting an item updates the hidden input and triggers the associated data update (e.g., refreshing charts).
- **Toggle**: Clicking the display area toggles the menu; only one menu can be open at a time.
- **Click Outside**: Clicking anywhere outside an open menu closes it.
- **Scrolling**: Menus with many options (e.g., the 10-year filter or long region lists) are now scrollable.

### Code Quality
- Reduced redundant event listener logic by approximately 40% across [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/dashboard.js) and [carbon-intensity.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/carbon-intensity.js).
- Standardized use of `data-value` attributes for selection values.
